You are avoiding the main topic. Neet paper leak, student deaths, education minister’s resignation. Mana CJP koi badi recognize party nahi. But atleast their protest is valid.  Gov ki G..D mat chat

Hundreds gathered at Jantar Mantar in New Delhi as the Cockroach Janata Party (CJP) held a protest demanding the resignation of Education Minister Dharmendra Pradhan over the NEET paper leak case

CJP founder Abhijeet Dipke led the protest and warned of nationwide demonstrations if the demand for the minister's resignation is not met

@aakaaanksha with more details.

@zoo_bear @SushantSin Any discussions on NEET during the CJP 's Jantarmantar protest on 6 June, except for typical rabid Leftist "azadi " slogans including the azadi for the traitor #Umarkhalid? 
It was not a protest for NEET but was against Modi.

Sit down, Sir.

@Manjina_Hani NSUI started NEET protest after CJP was born.

Water cannons - so nice in the hot sun. Never seen any deployed by BJP in any AAP protest. Kindness for INC 😌 INC🤝BJP

It was satire. He gets 1000s of messages from youth daily. Couldn't let them down. Braved threat of arrest etc. https://t.co/8Agu5XBbkY

@meerfaisal001 @zoo_bear The Media actually ran with it from Day 1, while the NSUI/IYC, which kept its foot on the ground as always, has been missing from the Noida channels; meanwhile, this meme page and its 100 people at protests were aired as the first big protest against NEET.
