Extended my full solidarity today to the Cockroach Janata Party and social activist Sonam Wangchuk at Jantar Mantar, Delhi, as they lead the protest demanding the resignation of Union Minister Dharmendra Pradhan. With millions of students’ lives at stake, our youth have taken to the streets. The Central Government has no alternative but to concede to their demands.

@Cockroachisback @abhijeet_dipke 

#cockroachjanataparty #cjp #jantar_mantar #neet #sonamwangchuk

As the Cockroach Janta Party's protests continue at Jantar Mantar, activist Sonam Wangchuk started an indefinite hunger strike from June 28 over alleged NEET paper leaks and to demand education minister Dharmendra Pradhan's resignation. Wangchuk has been publicly backing the movement and has participated in most of its demonstrations in Delhi. The fast adds another layer of pressure to a protest that has already drawn students, job aspirants and civil society voices demanding accountability, transparency and a response from the Centre.

 #SonamWangchuk #JantarMantar #CJP #NEET #Ladakh

