CITIZENS' VOICE SUPPRESSED! 

If your car or bike has suffered mileage drops or damaged parts because of Ethanol 20 blend petrol, your voice deserves to be heard!

The Hon'ble ​Union Minister shri Nitin Gadkari ji ji challenged us to bring even ONE vehicle owner facing issues due to #E20Petrol.

But when we tried to present the truth, @DelhiPolice detained us & now have even denied us the permission for a candle-light march!!
​
​So instead Team Bharat invites the citizens, the media to:

📍 Location: Jantar Mantar, New Delhi
⏰ Time: Tomorrow, 4:00 PM – 6:00 PM

Team Bharat also invites Hon'ble Union Ministers Hardeep Puri ji sir and Nitin Gadkari ji sir is they want to see real victims of the Ethanol 20 blending policy & hear their grievances.

